From 0b1cdab43d5dc18ebd4a4c89a4110e730e39154e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:07:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(hud): top bar is half as tall, on one row; Map and Dev
 buttons leave it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The hero's plate, the screens/system buttons and the actions share one 38px row
(was 76px). Labels give way in steps as the window narrows. The Map button goes
(M and the minimap click still open it; the minimap caption says "[M] map"); the
Dev button is gone from the bar and F2 still opens the bug-report menu.

Requested: "The top bar of the HUD should reduce its height by about half and consolidate all the items on one horizontal row. The button for Map should be removed and the “M” should move to above the minimap. F2 should just be hidden because most players won’t use it, but it should still function the same."

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RPnnd5XWLfE63iS3C1s8yq
